SUMMARY:[Curated Role Feeds] Title 5 License Maintenance Case
DESCRIPTION:Maine.gov\nAgencies\n|\nOnline Services\n|\nHelp\n|\nSearch Ma
 ine.gov\nDHHS\n→\nOffice of MaineCare Services (OMS)\n→\nProvider Reso
 urces\n→\n	 \n			Title 5 License Maintenance Case\nTitle 5 License Maint
 enance Case\nAug 11\, 2026\nProviders whose license is under a Title 5 rev
 iew may use your Title 5 notice to extend your enrollment with MaineCare i
 n MIHMS by six months\, and for every six months thereafter\, until the Ti
 tle 5 review is resolved. Providers must complete this update by submittin
 g a maintenance case via the Health PAS Online Portal. They can use the\nP
 rovider Maintenance User Guide\nfor step-by-step instructions.\nSelect the
  “Title 5 License Extension” from the licensing board drop-down menu a
 nd complete the maintenance case as usual. Providers can use the\nALMS web
 site\nto search for your license and must take a screenshot to upload with
  the maintenance case to show the Title 5 status.\nPlease ensure the "Term
  Date” is 6 months after the license expiration date. For example\, if y
 ou submit your Title 5 review and your license ends on January 30\, 2026\,
  extend the “Term Date” out to July 30\, 2026. As necessary\, repeat t
 his process every six months until the license is renewed. Once the licens
 e is renewed\, submit another case with the new term date of the license.\
 nProviders take note of your license expiration dates and plan to submit a
  maintenance case to update that license information a minimum of 30 days 
 prior to the license expiration date. Be sure to account for this when pl
 anning and submitting other maintenance cases.\nNote:\nMaineCare will\nnot
  reimburse providers\nfor services rendered when they fail to renew and up
 date your license within a maintenance case prior to its expiration.\nFor 
 questions about this process\, please contact Provider Enrollment at 1 (86
 6) 690-5585 option 2.\nhttps://www.maine.gov/dhhs/oms/providers/provider-b
 ulletins/title-5-license-maintenance-case-2026-08-11
URL:https://www.maine.gov/dhhs/oms/providers/provider-bulletins/title-5-li
 cense-maintenance-case-2026-08-11
CATEGORIES:Curated Role Feeds
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
